          "name": "Delete an encryption key",
          "request": {
            "name": "Delete an encryption key",
            "description": {
              "content": "Delete a specific encryption key.\n\n <br>**Note:** <em>This API is in **alpha**. While in alpha, APIs may change in a breaking way without notice; functionality may be removed, and no deprecation notices will be issued.\n If you are interested in using this API, please contact your Customer Success Manager (CSM).</em>",
